.TH HD-ISSUE 8 "October 2026" "hd-base" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-issue \- write the HyprDebian login banner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hd-issue
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hd-issue
writes the banner in
.IR /etc/issue ,
which the console shows above the login prompt:
.PP
.RS
.BI "HyprDebian " version " \(md " suite " \(md " console
.RE
.PP
with the version of HyprDebian from
.IR /etc/hyprdebian/version.json ,
the suite of the HyprDebian packages from
.IR /etc/apt/sources.list.d/hyprdebian.local.sources ,
and the name of the console.
.B HyprDebian
is shown in brown.
A value that cannot be found shows as
.BR unknown .
.PP
The postinst of
.B hd-base
runs it on every installation and upgrade.
Run it after changing the suite yourself.
.B hd-base
diverts the
.I /etc/issue
of base-files to
.IR /etc/issue.debian .
.PP
Run it as root.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/issue
The login banner.
.TP
.I /etc/issue.debian
The banner of base-files.
.TP
.I /etc/hyprdebian/version.json
The version of HyprDebian.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hd-base (7),
.BR agetty (8),
.BR issue (5)
.SH AUTHOR
Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
